#. from thunderbird:mail
msgid "The message has been deleted. The person you sent it to may or may not have seen it. They might undelete it at a later time and read it."
msgstr "Meddelandet har raderats. Personen som du skickade det till kan ha sett det men likaväl inte. De kan komma att återställa det senare och läsa det."

