msgid "The message was sent successfully, but could not be copied to your Sent folder."
msgstr "Meddelandet har skickats, men kunde inte kopieras till mappen skickade meddelanden."

#. from thunderbird:mail
msgid "There was a problem including the file %.200S in the message. Would you like to continue saving the message without this file?"
msgstr "Det uppstod ett problem med filen %.200S i meddelandet. Vill du fortsätta att spara meddelandet utan denna fil?"

